400 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 194 0 R
/E (       The Online Survey System is a web-based application designed to simplify and automate the process of conducting surveys. It provides a centralized platform where administrators can easily create surveys, add various types of questions, and distribute them to participants. Unlike traditional methods that rely on manual forms and physical distribution, this system enables quick setup, digital delivery, and instant collection of responses, making the entire workflow more efficient and accessible.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [2 3]
>>
endobj
401 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 194 0 R
/E (       The system operates through a structured architecture that connects the user interface, application logic, and database. Administrators and respondents interact with the system through a clean, responsive interface that ensures smooth navigation across all modules. The backend handles survey creation, response storage, validation, and retrieval, while the database securely maintains user data, survey content, and all submitted responses. This layered design ensures reliability, scalability, and consistent performance even when multiple users access the system simultaneously.)
/Pg 23 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
