<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 195 0 R
/E (      Online survey platforms play a crucial role in modern data collection by offering a fast, convenient, and cost-effective alternative to traditional survey methods. They eliminate the need for printed questionnaires, physical distribution, and manual data entry, which significantly reduces both time and effort. These platforms allow organizations to reach a wider audience instantly, making it easier to gather diverse and accurate feedback for academic, corporate, or research purposes.)
/Pg 24 0 R
/K [1 2]
>>
endobj
