435 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 202 0 R
/E (      The Survey Creation & Management Module enables administrators to design and organize surveys efficiently. This module provides tools to create new surveys, set titles, add descriptions, and define the purpose of the survey. Administrators can structure surveys using different question types such as multiple-choice, short answers, ratings, and checkboxes. The interface is designed to be simple and intuitive, allowing users to quickly add, edit, or delete questions without requiring any technical knowledge. This flexibility ensures that surveys can be tailored to various research, academic, or organizational needs.)
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [2 3]
>>
endobj
436 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 202 0 R
/E (         In addition to survey creation, the module supports seamless management of existing surveys. Administrators can view all surveys they have created, check their status, and modify them whenever necessary. They can activate or deactivate surveys depending on whether they are ready for distribution. The system also allows scheduling surveys by setting start and end dates, ensuring that respondents can only participate within a specified timeframe. This feature makes it convenient to manage ongoing and future surveys without manual tracking.)
/Pg 31 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
