/E (     For respondents, this module provides a clean and easy-to-use interface for answering survey questions. Each question is displayed in a user-friendly format that matches its type, ensuring clarity and reducing response errors. Validation checks are implemented to ensure that required questions are answered and that inputs follow the correct format. Once the user submits the survey, the system immediately processes the responses and stores them securely in the database. This eliminates the risks associated with manual data entry and guarantees that all responses are recorded accurately.)
/Pg 32 0 R
/K [4]
>>
