/P 204 0 R
/E (    The Data Analysis & Report Generation Module is responsible for transforming collected survey responses into meaningful insights that administrators can use for decision-making. Once responses are stored in the database, this module automatically retrieves the data and processes it to identify patterns, trends, and overall feedback. It organizes raw data into structured formats, ensuring that the information is accurate, complete, and ready for further analysis. This automation eliminates the need for manual calculations, significantly reducing human errors and saving valuable time.)
/Pg 33 0 R
/K [2 3]
>>
endobj
444 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 204 0 R
/E (        To make the results more understandable and visually appealing, the module generates graphical representations such as bar charts, pie charts, and summary tables. These visuals provide a clear view of how respondents have answered each question, making it easier for administrators to interpret the data at a glance. The module also supports comparative analysis for questions with multiple options, helping the user instantly identify dominant responses, common preferences, or areas that need attention. This enhances the overall quality and clarity of the survey findings.)
/Pg 33 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
