/Pg 36 0 R
/K [1]
>>
endobj
457 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 207 0 R
/E (    When compared to existing survey tools such as Google Forms, SurveyMonkey, and Typeform, the proposed Online Survey System offers a more tailored and customizable solution for specific organizational needs. While traditional tools provide basic survey creation and analytics, they often limit customization, especially for institutions that require domain-specific features. Many existing platforms also rely heavily on third-party integrations, which can create dependency issues and restrict full control over data handling and workflow design.)
/Pg 36 0 R
/K [2 3]
>>
endobj
458 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 207 0 R
/E (      Another important comparison involves performance, data privacy, and user experience. Most existing tools work well for general-purpose surveys but fall short when real-time analysis, automated filtering, and dynamic question rendering are needed. In contrast, the proposed system is optimized for faster data processing, secure storage, and direct access to insights without requiring external plugins. It also provides advanced features like personalized dashboards, restricted access levels, and improved visual analytics that many common tools do not offer in their free or entry-level versions.)
/Pg 36 0 R
/K [4]
>>
endobj
