/P 208 0 R
/E (     The Online Survey System successfully addresses the limitations found in existing survey platforms by offering a more structured, efficient, and user-centric approach to data collection. Throughout the development process, the system was designed to ensure fast survey creation, secure data storage, and easy accessibility for both administrators and respondents. The project also focused on improving usability, reducing manual workload, and delivering accurate insights based on real-time responses.)
/Pg 37 0 R
/K [3 4]
>>
endobj
463 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 208 0 R
/E (     By implementing automated processes and clear visualization tools, the system demonstrated how digital transformation can simplify large-scale data gathering. The inclusion of dashboards, charts, and organized reports helped users interpret patterns and trends more effectively. These visual insights not only improved understanding but also enhanced decision-making for academic, organizational, and research-related activities.)
/Pg 37 0 R
/K [5]
>>
