/P 209 0 R
/E (      The Online Survey System holds significant potential for further expansion and modernization. One major enhancement includes integrating AI-based analytics to automatically interpret response trends and generate predictive insights. Features such as sentiment analysis, automated report generation, and recommendation engines can make the system more intelligent and beneficial for large-scale research use. Additionally, future updates may support multilingual surveys, allowing users from diverse backgrounds to participate seamlessly.)
/Pg 38 0 R
/K [1 2]
>>
endobj
466 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 209 0 R
/E (      Another improvement includes incorporating advanced security features such as end-to-end encryption, biometric authentication, and role-based access control. These upgrades will make the system suitable for sensitive data collection in fields like healthcare, government surveys, and corporate evaluations. Moreover, integrating cloud-based deployment can help scale the system to support a larger number of concurrent users without compromising performance.)
/Pg 38 0 R
/K [3]
>>
