/E (       Finally, the scope extends to automated data processing and visualization to help users interpret survey results effectively. The system generates reports that include charts, summaries, and statistical insights based on the collected responses. This reduces manual effort and helps in faster decision-making. The project also includes scalability features, ensuring that the system can handle larger surveys and user traffic efficiently. Overall, the scope encompasses survey creation, participation, data security, analytics, and performance optimization to provide a complete end-to-end solution for online surveys.)
/Pg 22 0 R
/K []
>>
