/E (       On the frontend side, technologies such as HTML, CSS, and JavaScript are used to design a clean, responsive, and user-friendly interface for both administrators and respondents. HTML structures the pages, CSS enhances the design and layout, and JavaScript adds interactive features like form validation and dynamic content updates. Together, these technologies create an intuitive interface that improves usability and accessibility. The combination of Java, MySQL, and web technologies ensures that the Online Survey System is efficient, scalable, secure, and easy to use across different devices.)
/Pg 25 0 R
/K []
>>
endobj
