/P 197 0 R
/E (      The existing method also lacks real-time analysis and quick decision-making. Since data must be manually processed, generating reports, charts, or summaries takes considerable effort and delays the entire conclusion process. This makes it difficult for institutions or companies to react quickly based on survey findings. Overall, the existing system is inefficient, inaccurate, and not scalable, highlighting the need for a modern, automated solution like the Online Survey System.)
/Pg 26 0 R
/K []
>>
