/P 198 0 R
/E (    The proposed system also offers powerful analytical features that automatically generate charts, summaries, and detailed reports based on the collected responses. This enables faster interpretation of results, helping organizations make timely and informed decisions. Automated analysis saves a significant amount of manual work and ensures that insights are available immediately after the survey ends. Overall, the proposed Online Survey System enhances speed, accuracy, security, and scalability, making it a far superior alternative to traditional survey methods.)
/Pg 27 0 R
/K []
>>
